    "docs/package.json": {
      "nuxt-schema-org": "Held at ^6.2.1. Any bump drags nuxt-site-config 4.0.8 -> 4.2.3, which calls useModuleLogger and setupNitroRuntimeCompatibility; neither exists in @nuxt/kit@4.5.2, the newest published 4.x. Fails in dev:prepare, not at install. Upstream carries the same defect latently — their CI does not build the docs site. Revisit when @nuxt/kit exports both."
