    "package.json": {
      "happy-dom": "Pinned to exactly 20.12.0, not upstream's ^20.14.0, and not a caret of our own. Every version from 20.12.1 onward turns 1450 tests and 136 snapshots red with `TypeError: 'defineProperty' on proxy: trap returned falsish for property '__v_skip'` — Vue's markRaw against a happy-dom proxy, raised from reka's Presence watcher. Bisected: 20.12.0 green, 20.12.1 red, 20.12.2 red, 20.13.0 red, 20.13.1 red, 20.14.0 red, with every other bump in nuxt/ui@ebd4adfc applied. The range was `^20.12.0` before this and worked only because the lockfile happened to hold 20.12.0 — any fresh resolution would have taken 20.14.0, so this pin closes a landmine rather than adding a restriction. Upstream ships ^20.14.0; whatever differs is on our side (reka or vitest environment) and is not fixable inside a deps port. Revisit by unpinning and running the suite."
